<title>UK: Advance Bank Australia sets $300 mln five-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Advance Bank Australia sets $300 mln five-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ADVANCE BANK AUSTRALIA LTD</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  SPREAD     +12.5 BP  MATURITY	 NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.76     FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.76</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES  CALL AT PAR FROM NOVEMBER 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
